cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or its results, please cite the master's thesis it is part of (preferred citation below)."
title: "5LTEP-L1 Model Benchmark: local LLMs for PDF data dictionaries"
abstract: >-
  Monthly benchmark that picks the local LLM (Ollama, CPU-only GitHub
  Actions runner) used by 5L-TEP Layer 1 to turn PDF data dictionaries of
  open government data portals into field lists: staged evaluation (triage on
  a stratified sample, confirmation of finalists on the whole gold set), a
  gold set built from the public results of the Layer 1 instances (real PDFs
  confirmed by the published file's header, and declared schemas rendered in
  harder layouts), name-F1, exact match and Levenshtein metrics, a monthly
  runner budget and a paired bootstrap switch rule. Part of the master's
  thesis cited below.
